  "id": "fms",
  "term": "FMS",
  "definition": "FMS stands for fine motor skills: the small hand and finger movements used to grasp and manipulate objects with precise hand-eye coordination. In this context, it includes visual-motor integration and fine motor coordination, which are related but distinct abilities that develop along different paths.",
